<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-20T07:48:38.457Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:48:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent attacks include gunmen killing 15 soldiers in a convoy in Borno and a bomb explosion on a Borno road that killed nine soldiers, while bandits killed three policemen in Zamfara. In Benue, police rescued an abducted Catholic priest and seven others, and in Plateau gunmen attacked herders, killing two and injuring six, with reports of house burnings targeting Fulani communities. Islamist jihadists burned an evangelist alive in Adamawa and kidnapped a Catholic priest in Benue, also striking bases. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPTXZOZlFXZVZMeFpHRTNuRUw1b2pzaDVXT1gzdzJBdzJVVF9KMk9ZTWpPeVhKbC1RVy00TTR2eFVzbmJwVFAwc1V5cjZ1SFhOOUc5TVBxcFk0TjJzck1pcFBseGxObzF2Zml4Y1NHZGtSQ29SOHp4TTFzNm50REVmYVRSLW13SklfNjlfQXhrZ0J1RGZQR19YR0ZiMFo0azMz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;TheStar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOenRuXzZlaEZuSXZKenRJOGlKTFNRM1B1c3l4VzJkSjF1WU9CejRkWHFxZlJSc3NjWFNSQlRNU1VCQ0VaMjBkOXB5QUxoZmdvZ2h6alBGRVFGSjByMWtlWGVQUzJ4akZsdS1VWEZkNHVlOFJ0Y19LOTJYRV81Nm1KUFJya2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNRmFZVXhqbUI5dkhia2RTM3dzV01fRm5QbjFlNjFyUnZYYU5fQ1Q2aFQ5eDBsNUZSelJ5dGJwM1FVZTYyX1FnZ0RxXzR5QjM4Z1RFeU9ZbE5zblZBZkJmeDRydTlTVUZlM1F1MDhZWW9wMmN1WUtmT2FrQU1XV0xIWlRXOUhvX0NIalk1d2kwaVh5UUpLVXZFUFVOa29SZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOdmhXVTRjZmt0dUxDOU5pR05ZYnhGbUdCSlB3QkpYM1N1MzZ6b005eC1oQWFOWkdlQzFwdGFWQUJVc1JELUVqanJkTmJ0X2htbWJTeU54RFJIblZLSW9CLXhVNDhyMWFUVk9DR2tBRTNKVGFFQTVDcjl5dWJsUzREbGRGQmgtSDdoVmNzR05qc19telIy?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch 